{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23233","headline":"重到江州感旧游题郡楼十一韵 · 白居易","name":"重到江州感旧游题郡楼十一韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掌纶知是忝，剖竹信爲荣。\n才薄官仍重，恩深责尚轻。\n昔徵从典午，今出自承明。\n凤诏休挥翰，渔歌欲濯缨。\n还乘小艛艓，却到古湓城。\n醉客临江待，禅僧出郭迎。\n青山满眼在，白发半头生。\n又校三年老，何曾一事成。\n重过萧寺宿，再上庾楼行。\n云水新秋思，闾阎旧日情。\n郡民犹认得，司马咏诗声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}